## First Step for Cline
> "Scaffold the Vite + Three.js project, install dependencies (three, cannon-es, vite), and create the basic scene with a flat road plane textured gray, a directional sun light, and a blue sky background. Place a simple box as the player car at the center of the scene with WASD movement. Output all files."